<title>USA: JP Morgan wins $124 mln Maricopa County, Ariz. GOs.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan wins $124 mln Maricopa County, Ariz. GOs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc said it won $124 million of Maricopa County Community College District of Maricopa County, Ariz., general obligation bonds, Project of 1994, Series B (1997), with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.3218 percent.</p>
</text>
